  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童建筑堡垒帐篷拼搭套装",
    "en": "Kids Fort Tent Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童建筑堡垒帐篷拼搭套装，采用PP结构件，支持拼装积木与帐篷场景的组合搭建，适用于家庭互动和课堂活动。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，适合创意拼搭与反复拆装使用。",
    "en": "This is a kids fort tent building set using PP structural parts. It supports combined construction of block-style and tent-style layouts for family interaction and classroom activities.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. It is suitable for creative building and repeated assembly."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童建筑堡垒帐篷拼搭套装以模块化结构为核心，可搭建堡垒、帐篷和通道等多种形态，适合儿童进行连续创意构建。",
      "产品可用于亲子互动、课程道具和活动空间布置，支持空间认知、动手能力和协作玩法训练，适合重复拆装使用。",
      "包装为彩盒，提供体积与尺寸参数，便于渠道陈列、仓配管理和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids fort tent building set is built around a modular structure and supports multiple layouts such as forts, tents, and tunnels for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It is suitable for parent-child interaction, educational props, and event-space setup, supporting spatial learning, hands-on skills, and collaborative play with repeatable assembly.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging and includes volume and size data for channel display, warehouse management, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
